## Problem classes

### `Background invite never appears`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| Accept UI only shows while the activity is resumed | Android blocks background activity starts. Full-screen intents are special access. | Request display-over-apps and full-screen intent. Show a dialog when granted. Fall back to a heads-up notification with Accept and Decline. Desktop raises a window. |

